'''Medusa Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 9.0 Update|Version 9.0]] who can be unlocked when beating the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[The Pure Land (Merciless)|Courts of Torment]] appearing on the '''11th''', '''12th''', '''25th''' and '''26th''' of every month. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]] improves HP, Freeze chance, and Freeze duration.

