==Trivia==
*Medusa Cat's namesake is [[wikipedia:Medusa|Medusa]], a well-known [[wikipedia:Gorgon|Gorgon]] from Greek mythology.
*When adding Medusa Cat's [[True Form]] in [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]], [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]] made several alterations to her first two Forms' descriptions. The most notable one is the removal of "place." from the third line of her Normal Form's description, which rendered the sentence above it incomplete.
*Naga Cat's Japanese namesake is [[wikipedia:Nāga|Nāga]], a mythical race of half-human half-snake people.
*[[Medu-san]]'s hair looks the same as Medusa Cat's. However, Medu-san's is black with yellow eyes.

